@baseUrl = https://localhost:7179

### 1) List all passengers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/passengers
Accept: application/json

### 2) Add passenger (Deney D1: send this twice)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/passengers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Mehmet",
  "lastName": "Demir",
  "email": "mehmet@example.com",
  "passportNumber": "TR7654321"
}

### 3) Get passenger by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/passengers/1

### 4) Update passenger
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/passengers/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ayşe",
  "lastName": "Yılmaz Kaya",
  "email": "ayse@example.com",
  "passportNumber": "TR1234567"
}

### 5) Delete passenger with a reservation (Restrict → 500 for now)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/passengers/1

### 6) Non-existent passenger
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/passengers/999
